Output apply-hooks.gif
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "source $WTM_PROOF_SANDBOX/env.sh; clear"
Enter
Show

Type "wtm-next create feat/h1 feat/bad-h feat/h3 --yes"
Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /create: /
Sleep 4s
